1. a = 1.5 above DEFINT A-Z, b = 1.5 below: a, b, a! 0  2  1.5 
2. x = 2.5: x, x / 2, LEN(x) 2  1  2 
3. AS and suffixes win:  1.5  2.5 q 8  4 
4. DIM lg AS LONG, then DEFSTR L: lg, LEN(lg) 100000  4 
5. DEFDBL D below DEFINT A-Z: i, d 2  1.5 
6. DEFLNG a-c, x: b3, d3, x3, c3 100000  1.5  70000  2 
7. DEFSTR S: text! 4 
8. DEFLNG G skipped by GOTO: g, LEN(g) 2  4 
9. DEFDBL H in an IF block that does not run: h .3333333333333333 
10. DEFINT z-w: v4 to z4 2.5  2  2  2  2 
11. defint k, K, k-m, l: k5 to n5 2  2  2  2.5 
12. __a under DEFINT A-Z: 2.5  4 
    after DEFINT _, y-z: __b; after DEFDBL y-_, y: __c, y6, z6, x6 0  2.5  2.5  2.5  2 
13. two statements on one line: LEN(q7), LEN(r7) 2  4 
14. DIM t(3), dv and DIM SHARED gv under DEFINT A-Z: 2  2  2  2  2  2 
15. a FOR variable: 3  2 
16. CONST ck = 2.5, CONST s1 = 5 under DEFSTR S, CONST kk = a string under DEFINT:  2.5  6 abc!
17. INTEGER 2  2 
    LONG 2  4 
    SINGLE 2.5  4 
    DOUBLE .3333333333333333  8 
    _FLOAT 2.5  32 
    _BYTE-1  1 
    _UNSIGNED _BYTE 255  1 
    _UNSIGNED INTEGER 65535  2 
